  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Consumer Behavior Change Campaign and Intelligence-Led Conservation Capacity Training to Address the Illegal Wildlife Trade in Trinidad and Tobago</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funds under this award are to be used to reduce the illegal wildlife trade in Trinidad and Tobago by launching a targeted, coalition-based behavior change campaign to reduce demand for illegal pet wildlife.</narrative>
  </description>
